gearsystem (3.5.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Support for YM2413
  * Native file dialogs
  * Drag and drop rom files to open
  * Overscan options
  * Improved Game Gear timings
  * Improved PAL detection
  * Debugger improvements
  * Custom folders for saves and savestates
  * Scaling improvements like fit to window size or fit to window height
  * Hide cursor when hovering output window or when main menu is disabled
  * Load symbol files from command line
  * Support for WLA symbol files
  * Improve input response time
  * Save screenshots
  * Support for WSL
  * Automatic builds in GitHub Actions
  * Several bug fixes
  * Add support for zoomed sprites in SMS/GG modes
  * Pixel perfect rendering even with non integer HDPI values on Windows
  * Fixed bug where when resetting, the first opcode would not be
    disassembled. by @samizzo
  * Added a generalised shortcut system so any gui events can have a
    shortcut key defined in the config.ini by @samizzo
  * add retrofw target by @Poligraf
  * Fix window title flicker by @clbr
  * Define install and uninstall targets by @TomChapple
  * Update NFDe implementation to v1.1.1 by @TomChapple
  * @samizzo made their first contribution
  * @Poligraf made their first contribution
  * @clbr made their first contribution
  * @TomChapple made their first contribution

